@startuml
title Option B — durable timer failover, worker crash and late signal
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "Temporal Service\n+ durable history DB" as Temporal
participant "Workflow worker" as WF
participant "Activity worker" as Activity
participant "SMS-A / SMS-B" as SMS
participant "Email" as Email
participant "Receipt Gateway\n+ durable receipt_outbox" as Receipt

note over Temporal, WF: Push accepted, no authenticated app receipt by t0+8s.
Temporal -> WF: TimerFired + current history
WF -> Temporal: Schedule SMS-A activity(attempt_id)
Temporal -> Activity: SMS-A activity task
Activity -> SMS: Send(stable attempt_id idempotency key)
alt Activity worker crashes after provider accepted
  Temporal -> WF: Activity timeout (submit MaximumAttempts=1)
  WF -> Temporal: Schedule separate reconcile Activity(same attempt_id)
  Temporal -> Activity: Safe reconcile Activity task
  Activity -> SMS: Query status by stable attempt_id
  note over Activity, SMS: Unsafe submit is not retried automatically.\nSubmit retry only with contractual idempotency and same key.\nStatus-query retries are safe; workflow replay is not exactly-once I/O.
else Definitive provider rejection
  SMS --> Activity: Not accepted
  Activity -> Temporal: Definitive failure result
  Temporal -> WF: Workflow task
  WF -> Temporal: Schedule SMS-B activity (new attempt_id)
  Temporal -> Activity: SMS-B activity task
  Activity -> SMS: Send through independent SMS-B
else Network result unknown
  Activity -> Temporal: UNKNOWN result
  WF -> Temporal: Durable status-query timer until t0+30s
  Temporal -> Activity: Query same attempt
  Activity -> SMS: Query attempt_id
  alt Still unknown at t0+30s
    Temporal -> WF: Reconciliation timer fired
    WF -> Temporal: Schedule eligible email; record duplicate risk
    Temporal -> Activity: Email activity
    Activity -> Email: Send(notification_id)
  end
end
SMS -> Receipt: Signed delivered receipt
Receipt -> Receipt: Persist receipt + outbox before HTTP ACK
Receipt -> Temporal: Retried Signal(receipt_id, delivered evidence)
Temporal -> WF: Workflow task; ordered history / receipt_id dedup
WF -> Temporal: Mark DELIVERED; cancel not-yet-dispatched work
note over Temporal, Activity: Replay recovers workflow state after restart.\nLate signals stop future work; already-sent SMS cannot be recalled.
Temporal -> WF: At60s unresolved: SLO breach; continue recovery\nAt24h unresolved: escalate, do not report delivery
@enduml
